    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1965-p20.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The \\(r\\)th term is the difference of consecutive partial sums. Substitution and simplification give \\[S_r-S_{r-1}=6r-1.\\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C.",
